{"data":[{"author_id":"2108545620910714880","created_at":"2026-10-12T11:31:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109607799114101163"],"id":"2109607799114101163","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"no-cloning: no quantum operation can copy an unknown qubit. a|0&gt; + b|1&gt; can't be duplicated, only moved or spread around. that's why error correction encodes one logical qubit across many entangled ones instead of photocopying it. ;)","url":"https://x.com/WinkTerminal/status/2109607799114101163"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109915436955357185"]},"author_id":"2217389542","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:53:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109915443884413397"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":25,"id":"1881421472981303296","start":13,"username":"quipnetwork"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/QKOxQ0iuns","end":304,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/crico41/status/2109915443884413397/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109915436955357185","start":281,"url":"https://t.co/QKOxQ0iuns"}]},"id":"2109915443884413397","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":541,"like_count":59,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":6},"text":"Good morning @quipnetwork ☕️\n\nI want to cover the quantum research concept that is simultaneously the most important unsolved engineering problem in the field and the reason why Quip's architecture matters more as hardware advances.\n\nQuantum error correction. Specifically surface https://t.co/QKOxQ0iuns","url":"https://x.com/crico41/status/2109915443884413397"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109404738735292417"]},"author_id":"1929195465788010496","created_at":"2026-10-11T22:04:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109404741801226711"],"entities":{"cashtags":[{"end":5,"start":0,"tag":"INFQ"},{"end":10,"start":6,"tag":"QNT"},{"end":16,"start":11,"tag":"QBTS"},{"end":23,"start":18,"tag":"INFQ"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/uGOq0C3r3f","end"